    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάννᾰ</span></b> , ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, μάννα λιβάνου</span> frankincense <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>powder</i> or <i>granules</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.68.6
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. λιβανωτοῦ</span>
